{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/GIF_COMPRESSED.gif?t=1742409874\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ARTIUS: Pure Imagination</strong> is a fast-paced, momentum-driven platformer all about movement, creativity, and expression. Play as four unique artists, each with their own abilities, and fight to preserve creativity in a world on the brink of artistic extinction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/pierrejog-emmx787b.gif?t=1742409874\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is losing its spark. Inspiration is fading. The forces of uniformity are closing in. But ART will not go quietly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/renespin1-zi7imqjn.gif?t=1742409874\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That\u2019s where you come in. Take control of Pierre, Ren\u00e9, Walter and Guga\u2014each representing a different artistic discipline\u2014and use their unique talents to restore color, music, and imagination to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/waltejhrrrrr-qnchjqu6.gif?t=1742409874\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a mix of high-speed platforming, stylish moves, and expressive gameplay, <strong>ARTIUS</strong> lets you <strong>dash, paint, sculpt, compose, and create</strong> your way through dynamic hand-drawn worlds inspired by the very essence of art itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/guga-yqpasvbb.gif?t=1742409874\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RUN, JUMP &amp; EXPRESS YOURSELF in a momentum-driven platformer!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>IMMERSE YOURSELF in vibrant, hand-crafted worlds inspired by different art forms!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MASTER the unique abilities of four distinct artists!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FACE OFF against surreal foes trying to erase creativity from existence!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DISCOVER a cozy, creative hub world brimming with secrets and inspiration!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/extras/pivolowalk__1_.gif?t=1742409874\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WISHLIST NOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ONLY YOU CAN STOP THE ARTISTIC EXTINCTION.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3599920?t=1742409874","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3599920?t=1742409874","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/d26df2ee025bde399dae886120121c7ea6a52a7b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742409874","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599920/d26df2ee025bde399dae886120121c7ea6a52a7b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742409874","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.ak